Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:11.42,Default,LadyA,0,0,0,,That's Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:13.15,Default,LadyA,0,0,0,,He's spent the past few years
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.15,0:00:16.83,Default,LadyA,0,0,0,,traveling across several countries \Njust to further his own knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:18.78,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,He transferred to Lapis Lazuli Academy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:22.24,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,because he wanted to end \Nhis travels by studying properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:23.84,Default,LadyB,0,0,0,,He's so passionate!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:26.51,Default,LadyC,0,0,0,,I hear he's brilliant with the sword, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.33,0:00:35.54,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:39.36,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,you are front and center today, \NPrince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.85,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Elliot?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.85,0:00:44.58,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I hear you have your own fan club now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.58,0:00:47.14,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,and its membership grows by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.73,0:00:50.45,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Only because a foreign prince \Nis a novelty, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:52.85,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Anyway, did you find \Nthe books I asked for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.85,0:00:56.36,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Yes, in the library. There are a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:57.70,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:00.44,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,It's good that you're \Nas studious as you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.44,0:01:03.46,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,but perhaps it would do you good \Nto look elsewhere now and then?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:04.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:10.17,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,You've received invitations \Nfrom so many young ladies,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:12.53,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,yet you've refused them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.72,0:01:16.22,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should \Naccept one for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.55,0:01:18.93,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,There are so many books I want to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:22.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,There are many here that we don't \Nhave in Marinforest. They intrigue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.63,0:01:27.78,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I want to be worthy of the title \Nof crown prince of Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.27,0:01:29.83,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I wish for nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:38.03,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,There is nothing else that I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:55.53,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,When I saw her smile, \Nsomething in my heart made a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:14.41,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:31.98,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\pos(320,123)\c&HB36BF7&\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&H343E6B&}A {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Proposal Sweeter{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Than {\c&HFC8A3D&}{\b1}Honey{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:35.21,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I met her a year ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:38.57,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,at a soirée that was held to welcome me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.49,0:03:42.19,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,It's been a long time, Prince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:43.49,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:46.08,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,As am I, Prince Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.50,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I look forward to studying \Ntogether during my year here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:51.85,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Same. Let me introduce you \Nto my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.68,0:03:58.35,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,A pleasure to make your acquaintance, \NPrince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.84,0:04:03.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,My name is Tiararose Lapis Clamentile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:07.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It is a great honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:11.26,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Her courteous language, \Nher soft manner of speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:15.31,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,her flawless etiquette, \Nher polished demeanor...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:17.40,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,The effort she'd put in was plain as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:20.29,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I am Aquasteed Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.29,0:04:23.58,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose, \Nit is a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.81,0:04:28.91,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,She was so dignified at all times
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:31.28,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,and spared no effort in anything she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.42,0:04:34.18,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Whenever she saw someone in need,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:36.63,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,she'd talk to them and offer her aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:39.26,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,She'd never pretend she hadn't seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:43.34,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,There I was, trying to be \Na worthy crown prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:47.65,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,while she carried herself with the \Ndignity of a lady of the Lapis name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:52.49,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,We were similar in the way we both \Nconstantly disciplined ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:57.28,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,But whenever she ate sweets...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:00.78,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,The contrast delighted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:07.79,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:10.53,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.32,0:05:15.00,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Isn't that Prince Hartknights' fiancée...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.71,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:19.72,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,She's out there almost every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:22.38,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Oh? Every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.94,0:05:27.34,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,And as I watched her every day, \Nmy interest in her grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:30.78,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,What book is she reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:33.73,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,What is she saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:38.19,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,What is this roaring in my chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:44.77,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,You seem to be enjoying yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:47.35,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lately, you've been \Ncoming here not to read,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:49.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but to gaze upon \Nthe flowers, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.01,0:05:53.39,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,A flower... You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:57.14,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Watching her calms my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:01.62,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Rain...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:10.18,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.03,0:06:15.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Come forth, wind, \Nand disperse the clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:29.11,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:31.21,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Why did you use magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.21,0:06:33.12,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,You almost never use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:37.27,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Well... I didn't want her book to get wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:45.87,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I knew the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:48.47,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I was pretending not to realize it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.15,0:06:51.22,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,but I was in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.98,0:06:54.83,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,So, I wanted to give her something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:57.43,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Some small happiness...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:06:59.27,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,A smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:08.75,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,If I spoke to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:16.54,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,If I reached out, I could touch her. \NShe's close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:20.19,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,But I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.19,0:07:21.75,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I mustn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.05,0:07:27.62,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed, \Nwhy don't you try talking to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:29.85,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Don't get such ridiculous ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:32.43,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,She is Prince Hartknights' fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:35.02,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:39.96,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,One's first love is fleeting \Nand never comes to fruition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:46.07,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,All I'm allowed to do \Nis pray for her happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.27,0:07:54.86,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:02.19,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.09,0:08:07.19,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,She needs the infirmary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:14.65,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,What could have happened to make \Nsuch a strong young lady collapse?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:18.18,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Was it because of that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.89,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,The one who transferred in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:23.00,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,and immediately grew so close \Nto Prince Hartknights?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:26.61,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Perhaps he'll leave \NLady Tiararose for her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:28.24,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Such rumors spread quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:31.34,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,If that truly comes to pass, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:34.10,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:39.58,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for the trouble Tiara \Nhas caused you, Prince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.88,0:08:41.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:43.34,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I'll take over from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:49.35,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,It's her fiancé's job to stay by her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:56.74,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,That was my first time \Ntouching the girl I love...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:06.62,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,My time at this academy ends \Nwith tomorrow's graduation ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:10.91,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,All of these restless feelings \Nshould ease up after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:19.71,Flashback,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Tiararose, I hereby
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.71,0:09:22.58,Flashback,Hartknights,0,0,0,,call off my engagement with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:27.39,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,In that moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:30.47,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,a storm welled up inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:32.58,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,No more hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.56,0:09:35.01,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I'll follow my heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:38.16,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,to your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.81,0:09:41.40,Flashback,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.32,0:09:47.48,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I'll take the flower I could only \Ngaze at before into my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.18,0:09:56.95,Flashback,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Lady Tiararose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.17,0:10:00.12,Flashback,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.72,0:10:18.14,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,You called?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:19.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:21.34,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Send this to my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:22.72,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:28.19,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Flap your wings, break through \Nthe clouds, and fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:39.27,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I wrote in the letter that \NI would bring Lady Tiararose
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.27,0:10:42.45,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,back to Marinforest \Nwith me as my fiancée,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:46.71,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,so that she could live her life there \Nand want for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.71,0:10:49.54,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,It did seem like things were \Nheading in a good direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:51.46,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,but still, that was rather fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:54.47,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I feel silly for worrying over it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:58.22,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I know. I'm surprised, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:00.61,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,A new wish was born in my heart:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.61,0:11:03.51,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,to make Lady Tiararose my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:08.52,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Eventually, she agreed to marry me, \Nand my wish came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.07,0:11:10.30,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara's here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:13.46,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Yes. She wishes to see you today, \Nthough her visit was unannounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:14.51,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,May I let her in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:16.31,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Of course, right awa—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.31,0:11:17.50,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,You may not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.49,0:11:21.33,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Not until you've finished \Nthat pile of paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:29.54,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I want to see her as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:37.18,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,What's he after now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:49.63,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tell me, Prince Hartknights...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.63,0:11:53.81,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What were you trying to do \Nto my beloved fiancée?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:12:00.95,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:06.46,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.31,0:12:11.59,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What were you trying to do \Nto my beloved fiancée?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:15.25,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,His beloved fiancée?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.91,0:12:25.18,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:31.09,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'm sorry \NI took so long, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.95,0:12:35.34,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I've come to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.06,0:12:42.12,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Prince Hartknights, Tiara is my fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:45.54,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,What? You're engaged already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:46.83,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,Is it official?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:53.20,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes. We have the consent of King \NAlexander and Marquis Clamentile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.30,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.09,0:12:57.18,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I've informed my parents as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:58.16,Italics,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:13:02.23,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,So don't think you can \Ntouch her however you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:08.16,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,I-I apologize. I was not aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:11.48,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,If you understand now, \NI will overlook this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.75,0:13:13.83,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.83,0:13:14.98,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:17.94,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for coming here unannounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:20.37,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I was just thinking \Nof going to see you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:22.95,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm happy you came to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.57,0:13:25.51,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:26.49,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:44.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua, back there...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.49,0:13:50.56,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Don't. I am your fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:53.06,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Of course I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.12,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,My fiancé...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:13:59.33,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I know I accepted his proposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.33,0:14:02.41,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,but it's so embarrassing \Nto hear him say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:03.82,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,My heart is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:05.51,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:09.15,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you for choosing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:12.80,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I should say the same to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:15.54,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:23.13,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's like the scary version of him \Nfrom a moment ago never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:24.55,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I feel so safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:36.14,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,A whole cake packed with strawberries!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.51,0:14:38.80,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,A fancy tea set!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:44.50,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Afternoon tea with Prince Aqua \Nin a beautiful rose garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:47.03,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,This is too amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:49.51,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You also like cake, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.51,0:14:50.79,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.32,0:14:55.99,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Strawberries are a specialty of \NMarinforest, your home country, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.99,0:14:58.54,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,They're so cute and sweet \Nwith a hint of sourness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.54,0:15:01.31,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,They go well with so \Nmany different sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:05.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I love both eating them \Nand baking with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:09.01,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,In cakes, cookies, puddings...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:13.89,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry! I lost myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.43,0:15:16.67,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Ever since I got my memories \Nfrom my previous life back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.67,0:15:20.90,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to make \Na new dessert with strawberries...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.29,0:15:25.20,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,These were made with strawberries \Nfrom my home country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:27.66,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm glad it's made you so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.04,0:15:28.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:33.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:39.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.74,0:15:42.36,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.11,0:15:47.72,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:52.22,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I am Prince Aquasteed's attendant, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:55.35,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I'm not a noble, so I have no family name,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:59.04,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,but I have been serving Prince \NAquasteed for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:02.16,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's lovely to meet you, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.56,0:16:08.23,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I am Philine Sunfist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.23,0:16:12.13,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I have been serving Lady Tiararose \Nsince she was very small
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:16.75,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,and was formally appointed \Nas her personal maid a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:20.67,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Philine grew up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.67,0:16:25.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,She's been like an older sister, \Nalways by my side supporting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.77,0:16:28.06,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,And I always will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.06,0:16:30.76,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I will happily follow you to Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:36.04,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I enjoy serving you more than \Nwords can say, Lady Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:37.37,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Philine...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.78,0:16:40.28,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I will serve you forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:44.31,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,I hope you will continue to accept me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:47.28,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:49.30,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,She's a wonderful maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:50.42,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,She is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:07.53,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:14.41,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,So bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:17.59,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,This is way too boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:21.02,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Even Prince Hartknights \Nwon't come see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.75,0:17:24.14,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Why is it always Lady Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:27.46,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I love Prince Aqua, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:31.38,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,And I'm the heroine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:33.99,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,Oh! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:37.50,Default,Akari,0,0,0,,I just had a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:47.83,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:50.63,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,The sweets and tea \Nwere absolutely delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:52.32,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:54.97,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.19,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:09.45,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It was nice talking with the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:14.64,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but may I have some time \Nto talk to you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.64,0:18:18.72,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Y-You're very close, Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:22.34,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you for accepting my proposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:25.72,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but I don't want it to be just for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:28.29,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Give me a chance \Nto ask you directly once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.17,0:18:30.68,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:34.38,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I did sort of force you \Ninto it, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.99,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose Lapis Clamentile,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:43.30,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,will you be my consort?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.59,0:18:53.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes, it would be my pleasure, \NPrince Aquasteed Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:57.35,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:59.38,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:02.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm just so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.11,0:19:04.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.04,0:19:16.65,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,In the arms of the person I love...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:20.88,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's the kind of first kiss \Npeople dream of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.59,0:19:23.63,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:26.33,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.27,0:19:43.95,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You're just so adorable, I couldn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.54,0:19:45.70,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:50.21,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can't! I'm gonna die of embarrassment!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.15,0:19:54.04,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But... I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.51,0:20:02.79,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What is that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:08.93,Default,Hartknights,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.30,0:20:15.66,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:17.07,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.23,0:20:21.08,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Is this light... magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.82,0:20:27.61,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Could this be... \Nthe heroine's Holy Prayer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.61,0:20:34.09,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The Holy Prayer is a rare magic that \Nonly one person in this world can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.47,0:20:37.71,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Its light, with its power \Nof absolute purification,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.71,0:20:42.60,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,envelops the entire country, \Nrepels disasters, and brings peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:47.39,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Only the heroine of {\i0}The Ring \Nof Lapis Lazuli{\i1} can use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.13,0:20:50.95,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'd forgotten about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:54.94,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Lady Akari never used it, \Nso I thought she couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.71,0:20:58.25,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But... why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:04.99,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It seems to have stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.99,0:21:07.77,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,I'll go look. Please wait here for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.77,0:21:08.66,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.43,0:21:13.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Elliot is a capable attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.88,0:21:16.54,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll find the cause in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:19.83,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Lady Tiararose, you needn't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.83,0:21:22.05,Default,Philine,0,0,0,,Just wait here with His Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.68,0:21:28.56,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Every country wants \Nthe power of the Holy Prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:31.37,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's not just the Kingdom of Lapis Lazuli.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:36.04,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm sure the Kingdom of Marinforest \Nwould do anything to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.59,0:21:41.64,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What if Prince Aqua comes \Nto desire the heroine's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.21,0:21:46.45,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.05,0:21:50.54,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:53.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.94,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\b1\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&H343E6B&\blur4\bord1\pos(320,123)}The {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Sweetest Kiss{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}in the {\c&HFC8A3D&}{\b1}World{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.97,0:23:39.94,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&H343E6B&\bord1.75\pos(320,123)}The {\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Sweetest Kiss{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}in the {\c&HFC8A3D&}{\b1}World{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:34.31,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Every country wants the Holy Prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.31,0:23:35.87,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Does Prince Aqua, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.87,0:23:38.86,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Please, don't let go of me!
